# Methods and goal types added while growing the library on the development set, in order (fp_method_seq), with the stage
# that added them (fp_method_added). Each was proposed by the frame-filler from a dev problem and its worked solution, then reviewed:
# generalized (no domain words), merged with duplicates, kept only when reusable.

# ===== stage dev1: methods adopted after review (generalized, duplicates merged)

# --- goal type find_test
@fpg_find_test_1 fact
  holds fp_gtype find_test

@fpg_find_test_2 fact
  holds fp_gtype_text find_test "which observation or test separates competing hypotheses"

@fpg_find_test_3 fact
  holds fp_gtype_answer find_test entity or set

@fpg_find_test_4 fact
  holds fp_gtype_operation find_test "abduction (discriminating observation)"


